# Protocol 17 environment configuration
# Copy this file to .p17.env and fill in your values.
# .p17.env is git-ignored — it will never be committed.
#
# Precedence:
#   When this file exists, it is the workspace model configuration source of
#   truth — the editor (Translate / Test Model Connection) and the CLI use
#   these values, and VS Code "Configure Model" / SecretStorage values are
#   ignored until the file is removed.
#   For the CLI, existing shell P17_* environment variables take precedence
#   over this file; the file is fallback configuration there.
#
# ── Provider selection ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# P17_PROVIDER defaults to "openai-compatible" if not set.
# Supported: openai-compatible | anthropic | gemini
#
# P17_PROVIDER=openai-compatible

# ── openai-compatible (OpenAI, Ollama, DeepSeek, OpenRouter, etc.) ──
P17_API_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
P17_API_KEY=ollama
P17_MODEL=qwen3:4b-instruct

# ── anthropic ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# P17_PROVIDER=anthropic
# P17_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# P17_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-20251001

# ── gemini ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# P17_PROVIDER=gemini
# P17_API_KEY=...
# P17_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
